{
  "extends": "./shared.json",
  "$comment": "Owner console (dashboard / board / wizard / workspaces / lists / details): LCP ≤ 2.5 s, CLS ≤ 0.1, initial JS ≤ 260 KB gz (D-179, docs/performance-budgets.md) — a hard limit on every URL, the F2 workspaces included. Measured signed in (scripts/lhci.ts signs the owner persona in on the mock API and sends the session cookies). F2 2.6 adds settings, bank accounts, rate plans, members, notifications, privacy, subscription, a platform invoice and reports. F2 2.7 (R2) adds the service requests inbox and a request, the work orders and a work order, maintenance, locks and a lock, announcements and the composer, parcels, facilities and rules. One run per URL (34 URLs); the JS size does not vary between runs. Release fixes + B6 (2026-10-21): held payments list and a held payment, link requests, TM30, e-Tax list and detail, insights (server-drawn SVG charts, no chart library). The realtime stream is blocked (blockedUrlPatterns): an open event stream never lets the page go network-idle, so each run would wait out Lighthouse's 45 s load limit; maxWaitForLoad caps a page that still never goes quiet at 15 s (the metrics come from the trace either way).",
  "ci": {
    "collect": {
      "url": [
